"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Naming (ADR-0010): helpers are named after the Origami "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"patch"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", bare (no prefix) —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"disambiguate with the module ("},{"code":"OrigamiPatterns.Interaction","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") if it ever collides. This one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t clash with anything in SwiftUI."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Exposes the Interaction patch’s output ports as bindings\/callbacks so downstream SwiftUI","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"composes off them, matching the graph:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"down","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" while a finger is on the layer,"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position"},{"text":" — the touch point, in the layer’s coordinate space,","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onTap"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDoubleTap"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onLongPress"},{"type":"text","text":" — discrete pulses."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Only the gesture for an output you actually request is attached — so a tap-only layer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carries only a tap recognizer (no stray drag), which keeps gesture arbitration clean.","type":"text"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction/ViewModifier-Implementations":{"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction\/viewmodifier-implem